# The sentence spec.Sentence writes for testdata/templates/merge-my-sync-prs.json. Rewrite with
# go test ./internal/autopilot/spec -run TestSentenceGolden -update

When checks pass on pull requests opened by you, if the title starts with "[Sync] Update project files", the labels include automerge, and it isn't a draft, comment your "Sync OK" reply, then merge it with squash when GitHub allows, or past the rules when only an approval from someone else is missing, sensitive files included. At most 2 tries per pull request.
